Below is a **complete, ready‑to‑copy HTML file** that creates a clean, responsive “Coffee‑Shop” landing page.  
It uses only HTML + CSS (no external libraries) so you can drop the file into any web server or open it locally and see a fully functional mock‑up.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bean & Brew Coffee House</title>

    <!-- ==== Google Font ==== -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600&family=Roboto+Slab:wght@300;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        /* ==== Global Reset ==== */
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #fafafa;
        }

        a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

        img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

        /* ==== Layout ==== */
        header, footer { background: #4b2e2a; color:#fff; }
        header { padding: 1rem 2rem; position: sticky; top:0; z-index:10; }
        nav { display:flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items:center; }
        nav ul { display:flex; gap:1.5rem; list-style:none; }
        nav a { color:#fff; font-weight:600; transition:color .2s; }
        nav a:hover { color:#ffca28; }

        .hero {
            background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511925478372-8e3a2b2c2f6c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            color:#fff;
            text-align:center;
            padding:8rem 2rem;
            position:relative;
        }
        .hero::after{
            content:"";
            position:absolute;
            inset:0;
            background:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }
        .hero h1{font-size:3rem; margin-bottom:.5rem; position:relative; z-index:1;}
        .hero p{font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:2rem; position:relative; z-index:1;}
        .hero .btn{background:#ffca28; color:#4b2e2a; padding:.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius:5px; font-weight:600; position:relative; z-index:1;}

        .section { padding:4rem 2rem; max-width:1200px; margin:auto; }
        .section-title { text-align:center; margin-bottom:2rem; font-family:'Roboto Slab',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:2.2rem; color:#4b2e2a; }

        /* ==== Menu ==== */
        .menu-grid {
            display:grid;
            grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap:2rem;
        }
        .menu-item {
            background:#fff;
            border-radius:8px;
            box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            overflow:hidden;
            transition:transform .2s;
        }
        .menu-item:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);}
        .menu-item img { height:180px; object-fit:cover; }
        .menu-item h3 { padding:1rem .5rem 0; font-size:1.2rem; color:#4b2e2a; }
        .menu-item p { padding:.5rem 1rem 1rem; font-size:.95rem; color:#555; }

        /* ==== About ==== */
        .about { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:2rem; align-items:center; }
        .about img { flex:1 1 300px; border-radius:8px; }
        .about-text { flex:1 1 300px; }
        .about-text h2 { margin-bottom:.5rem; color:#4b2e2a; }
        .about-text p { margin-bottom:1rem; }

        /* ==== Location & Contact ==== */
        .contact-grid {
            display:grid;
            grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap:2rem;
        }
        .contact-card {
            background:#fff;
            padding:2rem;
            border-radius:8px;
            box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .contact-card h3 { margin-bottom:.5rem; color:#4b2e2a; }
        .contact-card a { color:#4b2e2a; font-weight:600; }

        footer { text-align:center; padding:2rem; font-size:.9rem; }

        /* ==== Responsive tweaks ==== */
        @media (max-width:600px){
            .hero h1{font-size:2.2rem;}
            .hero p{font-size:1rem;}
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- ==================== Header ==================== -->
    <header>
        <nav>
            <div class="logo"><strong>Bean & Brew</strong></div>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#menu">Menu</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">Our Story</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- ==================== Hero ==================== -->
    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Welcome to Bean &amp; Brew</h1>
        <p>Freshly roasted coffee, cozy vibes, and a place to call your own.</p>
        <a href="#menu" class="btn">Explore the Menu</a>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== Menu ==================== -->
    <section id="menu" class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Signature Drinks</h2>
        <div class="menu-grid">
            <article class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511925478372-8e3a2b2c2f6c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" alt="Espresso">
                <h3>Espresso</h3>
                <p>Rich, bold, and perfectly pulled – the classic starter.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511974035430-5de47d3b95da?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" alt="Cappuccino">
                <h3>Cappuccino</h3>
                <p>Velvety foam atop a balanced espresso‑milk blend.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512428559087-560fa5ceab42?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" alt="Latte">
                <h3>Latte</h3>
                <p>Smooth milk‑laden coffee, perfect for latte art.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" alt="Cold Brew">
                <h3>Cold Brew</h3>
                <p>Slow‑steeped for 12‑hours – smooth, low‑acid refreshment.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== About ==================== -->
    <section id="about" class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Story</h2>
        <div class="about">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526045478516-99145907023c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Coffee shop interior">
            <div class="about-text">
                <h2>From Bean to Cup</h2>
                <p>Founded in 2015, Bean &amp; Brew began as a tiny stall at the local farmer’s market. Our passion for ethically‑sourced beans and handcrafted drinks quickly turned us into a neighborhood staple.</p>
                <p>Today we roast our beans in‑house, support small‑scale farmers, and provide a warm space for creators, remote workers, and coffee lovers alike.</p>
                <p>Come for the coffee, stay for the community.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== Contact & Location ==================== -->
    <section id="contact" class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Get in Touch</h2>
        <div class="contact-grid">
            <div class="contact-card">
                <h3>Visit Us</h3>
                <p>123 Brew Lane<br>Seattle, WA 98101</p>
                <p>Open Mon‑Fri: 7am – 6pm<br>Sat‑Sun: 8am – 8pm</p>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-card">
                <h3>Call</h3>
                <p><a href="tel:+12065551234">+1 (206) 555‑1234</a></p>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-card">
                <h3>Follow</h3>
                <p>
                    <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank">Instagram</a> |
                    <a href="https://facebook.com" target="_blank">Facebook</a> |
                    <a href="https://twitter.com" target="_blank">Twitter</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== Footer ==================== -->
    <footer>
        © 2024 Bean &amp; Brew Coffee House • All rights reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
```

### How to Use It
1. **Copy the entire block** into a file named `index.html`.
2. Open the file in any browser – you’ll see a fully‑styled coffee‑shop landing page.
3. Replace the placeholder images (the Unsplash URLs) with your own photos or host them locally.
4. Adjust the text, contact details, and menu items to reflect your actual offerings.

Feel free to extend the page with:
- A **newsletter sign‑up** form (add a simple `<form>` inside the contact section).  
- **JavaScript** for a sticky “Back‑to‑Top” button or a modal reservation system.
